@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Active Directory SCIM API</h1>

<div class="row mt-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h5 class="card-title">Overview</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>This application provides a SCIM 2.0 interface for managing Active Directory objects:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Users</li>
                    <li>Groups</li>
                    <li>gMSA (Group Managed Service Accounts)</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Use the navigation menu to manage these objects and configure business rules for OU assignment.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-header">
                <h5 class="card-title">API Endpoints</h5>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p>SCIM 2.0 endpoints:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>/scim/v2/Users</code> - User management</li>
                    <li><code>/scim/v2/Groups</code> - Group management</li>
                </ul>
                <p>Custom API endpoints:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><code>/api/BusinessRules</code> - Business rules management</li>
                    <li><code>/api/Auth</code> - Authentication and user management</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>